{"seq":4,"slug":"legacy-code-modernization","title":"遗留代码现代化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/tech-debt-engineering/legacy-code-modernization","wordCount":1493,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"遗留代码现代化\">遗留代码现代化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>遗留代码按 Feathers 的定义是&quot;没有测试的代码&quot;，其危险在于无人敢改导致系统僵化；现代化因此不是一次重写，而是一个用测试和接缝逐步收复控制权的持续过程。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>以测试为界</strong>：判定遗留代码的依据是是否有测试保护，而非代码年龄。</li>\n<li><strong>修改恐惧的根源</strong>：无测试、缺文档、原作者流失、技术栈过时共同导致系统僵化。</li>\n<li><strong>表征测试</strong>：先为现有行为（哪怕看起来是 Bug）建立测试，把未知行为固定下来作为安全网。</li>\n<li><strong>接缝识别</strong>：找到可以插入测试或替换实现的接缝，是安全修改的入口。</li>\n<li><strong>渐进迁移</strong>：永远不要大爆炸重写，按路线图小步替换。</li>\n<li><strong>共存模式</strong>：防腐层与双写模式让新旧系统并行，隔离差异。</li>\n<li><strong>成功指标</strong>：用交付速度、Bug 修复时间、旧代码比例等指标衡量进展。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文后续的表征测试、接缝识别、渐进式迁移、共存模式与技术栈现代化策略，都是这些概念的具体展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是遗留代码\">什么是遗留代码</h2><p>Michael Feathers 在《Working Effectively with Legacy Code》中给出了一个精辟的定义：<strong>遗留代码就是没有测试的代码</strong>。不管它是昨天写的还是十年前写的，只要没有测试保护，修改它就是在走钢丝。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[遗留代码] --&gt; B[没有测试]&#10;    A --&gt; C[文档缺失]&#10;    A --&gt; D[原始作者已离职]&#10;    A --&gt; E[使用过时技术栈]&#10;    A --&gt; F[无人完全理解]&#10;    B --&gt; G[修改恐惧]&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[系统僵化]\">graph TD\n    A[遗留代码] --&gt; B[没有测试]\n    A --&gt; C[文档缺失]\n    A --&gt; D[原始作者已离职]\n    A --&gt; E[使用过时技术栈]\n    A --&gt; F[无人完全理解]\n    B --&gt; G[修改恐惧]\n    C --&gt; G\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[系统僵化]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"表征测试-characterization-tests\">表征测试（Characterization Tests）</h2><p>面对遗留代码，第一步不是理解它应该做什么，而是记录它<strong>实际上</strong>在做什么。表征测试就是为这个目的而设计的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"编写表征测试的步骤\">编写表征测试的步骤</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>活动</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>找到要修改的代码区域</td>\n<td>确定保护范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>用已知输入调用代码</td>\n<td>观察实际行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>用断言固定实际输出</td>\n<td>建立安全网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>用边界值和异常输入重复</td>\n<td>扩大保护范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>确认测试全部通过</td>\n<td>基线建立完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { describe, it, expect } from &#39;vitest&#39;;&#10;import { calculateShipping } from &#39;../legacy/shipping&#39;;&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;calculateShipping (表征测试)&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;小订单使用标准运费&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const result = calculateShipping({&#10;      items: [{ weight: 0.5, price: 20 }],&#10;      destination: &#39;domestic&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;    expect(result).toBe(8.0);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;大订单免运费&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const result = calculateShipping({&#10;      items: [{ weight: 2, price: 200 }],&#10;      destination: &#39;domestic&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;    expect(result).toBe(0);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;国际订单加收费用&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const result = calculateShipping({&#10;      items: [{ weight: 1, price: 50 }],&#10;      destination: &#39;international&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;    expect(result).toBe(25.0);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;空订单返回零&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const result = calculateShipping({&#10;      items: [],&#10;      destination: &#39;domestic&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;    expect(result).toBe(0);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { describe, it, expect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vitest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { calculateShipping } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '../legacy/shipping'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'calculateShipping (表征测试)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'小订单使用标准运费'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateShipping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      items: [{ weight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, price: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      destination: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'domestic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'大订单免运费'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateShipping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      items: [{ weight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, price: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      destination: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'domestic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'国际订单加收费用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateShipping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      items: [{ weight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, price: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      destination: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'international'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'空订单返回零'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateShipping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      items: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      destination: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'domestic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>表征测试不关心结果是否&quot;正确&quot;——如果遗留代码中有 Bug 但用户已经适应了这个行为，表征测试应该保护这个行为，直到有意识地决定修复它。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"接缝识别-seam-identification\">接缝识别（Seam Identification）</h2><p>接缝（Seam）是代码中可以改变行为而无需修改代码本身的位置。识别接缝是让遗留代码变得可测试的关键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"接缝类型\">接缝类型</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[接缝类型] --&gt; B[对象接缝]&#10;    A --&gt; C[预处理接缝]&#10;    A --&gt; D[链接接缝]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;通过依赖注入\\n替换实现&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;通过环境变量\\n改变行为&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;通过模块系统\\n替换依赖&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[接缝类型] --&gt; B[对象接缝]\n    A --&gt; C[预处理接缝]\n    A --&gt; D[链接接缝]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"通过依赖注入\\n替换实现\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"通过环境变量\\n改变行为\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"通过模块系统\\n替换依赖\"]</pre><p>在 TypeScript/JavaScript 中，最常用的接缝是<strong>参数接缝</strong>和<strong>模块接缝</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function processPayment(orderId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const order = await db.query(&#39;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE id = $1&#39;, [orderId]);&#10;  const result = await fetch(&#39;https://payment-api.com/charge&#39;, {&#10;    method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;    body: JSON.stringify({ amount: order.total }),&#10;  });&#10;  await db.query(&#39;UPDATE orders SET status = $1 WHERE id = $2&#39;, [&#39;paid&#39;, orderId]);&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function processPayment(&#10;  orderId: string,&#10;  deps: {&#10;    findOrder: (id: string) =&gt; Promise&lt;Order&gt;;&#10;    chargePayment: (amount: number) =&gt; Promise&lt;PaymentResult&gt;;&#10;    updateOrderStatus: (id: string, status: string) =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  },&#10;): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const order = await deps.findOrder(orderId);&#10;  await deps.chargePayment(order.total);&#10;  await deps.updateOrderStatus(orderId, &#39;paid&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM orders WHERE id = $1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [orderId]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://payment-api.com/charge'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    body: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ amount: order.total }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UPDATE orders SET status = $1 WHERE id = $2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, orderId]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\