583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PaymentResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    updateOrderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chargePayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order.total);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">updateOrderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>重构后的版本可以在测试中传入 mock 实现，而生产环境传入真实实现。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"渐进式迁移\">渐进式迁移</h2><h3 id=\"黄金规则-永远不要大爆炸重写\">黄金规则：永远不要大爆炸重写</h3><p>大爆炸重写（Big-bang Rewrite）几乎总是失败的。Joel Spolsky 将其列为&quot;软件公司最严重的战略错误&quot;之一。原因包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>功能遗漏</td>\n<td>旧系统的隐含行为很难在新系统中完全复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行维护成本</td>\n<td>重写期间旧系统仍需维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队疲劳</td>\n<td>长期看不到成果导致士气下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务停滞</td>\n<td>重写期间难以交付新功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二系统效应</td>\n<td>过度设计新系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"渐进迁移的路线图\">渐进迁移的路线图</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"gantt\" data-source=\"gantt&#10;    title 遗留系统现代化路线图&#10;    dateFormat YYYY-Q&#10;    section 基础准备&#10;    建立表征测试          :done, 2024-Q1, 1q&#10;    引入类型系统          :done, 2024-Q1, 1q&#10;    section 模块化&#10;    识别接缝和边界        :done, 2024-Q2, 1q&#10;    提取独立模块          :active, 2024-Q2, 2q&#10;    section 逐步替换&#10;    新功能走新架构        :2024-Q3, 2q&#10;    高风险模块迁移        :2024-Q4, 2q&#10;    section 清理&#10;    移除旧代码            :2025-Q2, 1q&#10;    架构优化              :2025-Q2, 1q\">gantt\n    title 遗留系统现代化路线图\n    dateFormat YYYY-Q\n    section 基础准备\n    建立表征测试          :done, 2024-Q1, 1q\n    引入类型系统          :done, 2024-Q1, 1q\n    section 模块化\n    识别接缝和边界        :done, 2024-Q2, 1q\n    提取独立模块          :active, 2024-Q2, 2q\n    section 逐步替换\n    新功能走新架构        :2024-Q3, 2q\n    高风险模块迁移        :2024-Q4, 2q\n    section 清理\n    移除旧代码            :2025-Q2, 1q\n    架构优化              :2025-Q2, 1q</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"共存模式\">共存模式</h2><p>在迁移过程中，新旧代码需要共存一段时间。以下模式帮助管理这种共存：</p>\n<h3 id=\"防腐层-anti-corruption-layer\">防腐层（Anti-Corruption Layer）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ModernUser {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  displayName: string;&#10;  email: string;&#10;  createdAt: Date;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LegacyUserRecord {&#10;  user_id: number;&#10;  first_name: string;&#10;  last_name: string;&#10;  email_address: string;&#10;  created_date: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class UserAntiCorruptionLayer {&#10;  constructor(private readonly legacyDb: LegacyDatabase) {}&#10;&#10;  async findById(id: string): Promise&lt;ModernUser | null&gt; {&#10;    const legacy = await this.legacyDb.query&lt;LegacyUserRecord&gt;(&#39;SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id = $1&#39;, [&#10;      parseInt(id, 10),&#10;    ]);&#10;    if (!legacy) return null;&#10;    return this.translate(legacy);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private translate(legacy: LegacyUserRecord): ModernUser {&#10;    return {&#10;      id: String(legacy.user_id),&#10;      displayName: `${legacy.first_name} ${legacy.last_name}`.trim(),&#10;      email: legacy.email_address,&#10;      createdAt: new Date(legacy.created_date),&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModernUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  displayName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  createdAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LegacyUserRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  first_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  last_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  email_address</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  created_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserAntiCorruptionLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> legacyDb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LegacyDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ModernUser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> legacy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.legacyDb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LegacyUserRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM users WHERE user_id = $1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      parseInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">legacy) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">translate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(legacy);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> translate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">legacy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LegacyUserRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ModernUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      id: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(legacy.user_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      displayName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">legacy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">first_name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">legacy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">last_name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      email: legacy.email_address,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      createdAt: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(legacy.created_date),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>防腐层确保新代码不受旧数据模型的&quot;污染&quot;，所有翻译逻辑集中在一处。</p>\n<h3 id=\"双写模式\">双写模式</h3><p>在数据迁移期间，同时写入新旧系统，确保数据一致性：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as 应用&#10;    participant New as 新系统&#10;    participant Old as 旧系统&#10;    participant Verify as 验证器&#10;&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;New: 写入数据&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Old: 同步写入旧系统&#10;    Verify-&gt;&gt;New: 读取新数据&#10;    Verify-&gt;&gt;Old: 读取旧数据&#10;    Verify-&gt;&gt;Verify: 比较一致性&#10;    Note over Verify: 不一致时发告警\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as 应用\n    participant New as 新系统\n    participant Old as 旧系统\n    participant Verify as 验证器\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;New: 写入数据\n    App-&gt;&gt;Old: 同步写入旧系统\n    Verify-&gt;&gt;New: 读取新数据\n    Verify-&gt;&gt;Old: 读取旧数据\n    Verify-&gt;&gt;Verify: 比较一致性\n    Note over Verify: 不一致时发告警</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"技术栈现代化策略\">技术栈现代化策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JavaScript → TypeScript</td>\n<td>渐进添加 .ts 文件 + allowJs</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>jQuery → React</td>\n<td>先在新页面用 React，旧页面保持 jQuery</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REST → GraphQL</td>\n<td>在 REST 前添加 GraphQL 网关</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Monolith → Microservices</td>\n<td>绞杀者模式，一次提取一个服务</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旧 ORM → 新 ORM</td>\n<td>防腐层 + 并行迁移</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"javascript-到-typescript-的渐进迁移\">JavaScript 到 TypeScript 的渐进迁移</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;allowJs&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;checkJs&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;strict&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;noImplicitAny&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;outDir&quot;: &quot;./dist&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;include&quot;: [&quot;src/**/*&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"allowJs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"checkJs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"strict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"noImplicitAny\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outDir\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"include\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/**/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分阶段提升严格度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>配置变更</th>\n<th>工作量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><code>allowJs: true</code></td>\n<td>零成本引入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><code>checkJs: true</code></td>\n<td>修复 JS 文件中的类型错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>将 .js 逐步改为 .ts</td>\n<td>添加类型注解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><code>strict: true</code></td>\n<td>修复所有严格模式错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"成功指标\">成功指标</h2><p>如何知道遗留代码现代化在正确的轨道上？</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n<th>健康趋势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>测试覆盖率</td>\n<td>被测试代码行 / 总代码行</td>\n<td>↑ 持续增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新功能交付速度</td>\n<td>Story Points / Sprint</td>\n<td>↑ 稳步提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bug 修复时间</td>\n<td>从报告到修复的小时数</td>\n<td>↓ 持续缩短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署频率</td>\n<td>每月部署次数</td>\n<td>↑ 从月度到每周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旧代码比例</td>\n<td>旧代码行 / 总代码行</td>\n<td>↓ 持续减少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新成员上手时间</td>\n<td>到第一次有意义提交的天数</td>\n<td>↓ 逐步缩短</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[遗留状态] --&gt; B[有测试保护]&#10;    B --&gt; C[有清晰接缝]&#10;    C --&gt; D[新旧共存]&#10;    D --&gt; E[逐步替换]&#10;    E --&gt; F[现代化完成]\">graph LR\n    A[遗留状态] --&gt; B[有测试保护]\n    B --&gt; C[有清晰接缝]\n    C --&gt; D[新旧共存]\n    D --&gt; E[逐步替换]\n    E --&gt; F[现代化完成]</pre><p>遗留代码现代化不是一个项目，而是一个持续的过程。它需要耐心、纪律和对细节的关注。最成功的现代化案例都有一个共同特点：它们从来不试图一步到位，而是通过无数个小步骤积累成变革性的结果。每一行被测试覆盖的遗留代码，都是向更健康的系统迈进的一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>遗留代码的本质是&quot;没有测试&quot;，危险来自无人敢改导致的僵化。</li>\n<li>表征测试先固定现有行为（含看似是 Bug 的行为），建立可修改的安全网。</li>\n<li>接缝是插入测试与替换实现的入口，识别接缝是安全修改的前提。</li>\n<li>渐进迁移优于大爆炸重写：小步替换才能持续保持系统可用。</li>\n<li>防腐层与双写等共存模式让新旧系统并行，隔离差异与风险。</li>\n<li>现代化是持续过程而非一次性项目，用交付与修复指标衡量进展。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"遗留代码现代化","id":"遗留代码现代化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是遗留代码","id":"什么是遗留代码"},{"level":2,"text":"表征测试（Characterization Tests）","id":"表征测试-characterization-tests"},{"level":3,"text":"编写表征测试的步骤","id":"编写表征测试的步骤"},{"level":2,"text":"接缝识别（Seam Identification）","id":"接缝识别-seam-identification"},{"level":3,"text":"接缝类型","id":"接缝类型"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进式迁移","id":"渐进式迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"黄金规则：永远不要大爆炸重写","id":"黄金规则-永远不要大爆炸重写"},{"level":3,"text":"渐进迁移的路线图","id":"渐进迁移的路线图"},{"level":2,"text":"共存模式","id":"共存模式"},{"level":3,"text":"防腐层（Anti-Corruption Layer）","id":"防腐层-anti-corruption-layer"},{"level":3,"text":"双写模式","id":"双写模式"},{"level":2,"text":"技术栈现代化策略","id":"技术栈现代化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"JavaScript 到 TypeScript 的渐进迁移","id":"javascript-到-typescript-的渐进迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"成功指标","id":"成功指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"重构策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/tech-debt-engineering/refactoring-strategies"},"next":{"title":"开发者体验优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/engineering-productivity/developer-experience-optimization"}}